Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:50.06,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}テレスコープのぞいて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:52.41,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}見つめてる君
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:55.48,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そこにある日常は
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:57.49,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まるでさかさま
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:00.86,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}地に足がつかないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:03.27,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}こころうわの空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:06.28,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}行き場のない想いは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:08.38,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}苦しくなるだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:15.54,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}ああ、辛いや
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:22.55,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}“もしも”なんて呪文
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.55,0:22:25.28,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なんの効力もないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:30.36,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部ぜーんぶ　わたしとならいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.36,0:22:32.67,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って思ってしまうんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.67,0:22:35.45,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}好きだよ。好き？大好きだ。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:38.09,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って言えていたのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.09,0:22:40.30,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}食べかけのフローズン
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.30,0:22:43.68,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}シャリシャリなメモリーズ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.11,0:22:45.14,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:46.49,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}足りない　足りない　足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.49,0:22:49.02,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}君成分が足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:50.52,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:51.21,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}触れたい　触れたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:54.45,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}冷たい愛凍えちゃう前に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:57.98,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}温めてよね　お願い
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:50.06,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}透過望遠鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:52.41,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}注視著的你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:55.48,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}眼前的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:57.49,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}彷彿顛倒一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:00.86,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雙腳無法踏實著地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:03.27,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}心思早已浮上雲端
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:06.28,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}無處安放的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:08.38,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}只會感到痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:15.54,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}啊 好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:22.55,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}「假如」這類的咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.55,0:22:25.28,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雖然沒有任何效果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:30.36,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部全部 都能和我一起就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.36,0:22:32.67,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}還是忍不住會這樣想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.67,0:22:35.45,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}喜歡你。喜歡？超喜歡。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:38.09,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}明明能說得出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.09,0:22:40.30,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}吃到一半的冰沙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.30,0:22:43.68,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}留下沙沙作響的回憶
Comment: 0,0:22:43.11,0:22:45.14,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:46.49,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不夠 不夠 還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.49,0:22:49.02,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}你的成分還不夠
Comment: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:50.52,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:51.21,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}想觸碰 想觸碰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:54.45,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在冰冷的愛凍結之前
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:57.98,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}請你將它溫暖起來
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
